          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_every_table_different_schema_trained",
          "text": "Every table has a different schema, so a model trained on one rarely transfers to another. This paper introduces UniTabE, a universal pretraining protocol that handles any table uniformly.",
